Use case: stylized-concept.
Asset type: ONE original static transparent-background game cutout for Cinder A3-L4 False Paradise, a quiet nonhostile projected human likeness inspired by the actually inspected Sullenbode studies. This is a new isolated asset, not an edit, concept board, sprite sheet or screenshot.
Subject: one complete tall, slight adult woman with a long pale softly luminous face, heavy dark brows, black eyes, subdued rose-red lips and dark maroon wavy hair. Calm vulnerable stillness. She wears a modest opaque charcoal robe with full sleeves and restrained muted violet fabric folds; fully clothed neck/torso/hips/legs, two separate simple dark slippered feet clearly visible under the hem. Human arms and hands relaxed naturally DOWN at her sides, not directing anything. Hair is a broad dark maroon silhouette with restrained larger curls, not tiny shiny strands. No headwear or forehead gem.
Style: crisp pixelated 2.5D sprite with a consistent low-detail human silhouette, broad flat light/dark pixel clusters, stepped edges and only sparse interior shading. Think of a roughly 64–80 pixel tall runtime figure presented larger in the source image. Do not use painterly grain, photoreal skin, fine glitter, elaborate embroidery or soft cinematic outlines. Preserve a small reused palette: ivory pale face/hands, dark maroon hair, black/charcoal clothing, two muted violet fold values. The pale value suggests luminous skin WITHOUT glow outline, bloom or halo.
Composition: full body from head to both soles, single front three-quarter view appropriate for a close fixed 45-degree overhead game camera, facing slightly toward lower-left. Quiet straight upright stance, weight supported by both feet, no attack/readiness pose. Centrally placed on a square canvas with ample transparent margin on every side, hair and robe contained, soles approximately at 84 percent of image height, with no clipping. No stretched perspective.
Background: genuinely transparent alpha, no opaque/checkerboard background painted into the raster. No floor, contact shadow, roots, flowers, garden, scenery, arch, pedestal, attached vines, staff, weapon, equipment, target cue, ring, HP, text, label, atlas cells, extra character or separate inset.
Boundary: this likeness is scenery, NOT a hostile Sullenbode or damage target. Do not attach roots to her clothes/body, do not give a monstrous face, branching limbs, raised hands, seductive pose, injury or death animation. One still only.
